# Netlify rewrites/redirects
# Proxy all /api/* traffic to the Render backend. The hard-coded public URL
# below is NOT a secret (it's the same value already visible in the browser).
# It was previously flagged only because a Netlify env var ("VITE_API_URL")
# held the same value and was marked secret — that env var has been removed.
/api/*    https://expiryos-api.onrender.com/api/:splat   200

# SPA fallback: serve index.html for any non-file path.
/*    /index.html   200
